/T (The objective of this practical is to build a low-latency, bidirectional, event-driven Real-Time Chat Application using Socket.IO on a Node.js/Express backend and a React.js client. The system implements channel/room partitioning \(socket.join\), real-time message broadcasting, dynamic typing indicators, and connection lifecycle management.)
